WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.230
Two identical masses hang
on two identical springs.

2
00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:05.840
Set one bobbing.

3
00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:08.520
A moment later, set the other going.

4
00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:12.580
They share the same period, but
they never quite move together.

5
00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.000
One always trails the other.

6
00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.220
You could give the delay in seconds.

7
00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:21.420
But is there one number that says
how far out of step they are?

8
00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:25.360
In this mission, you'll pin down
exactly where an oscillator is,

9
00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:27.460
at any instant you choose.

10
00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:32.660
Then you'll test a surprising claim:
a bigger swing takes no longer.

11
00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:37.740
Your mission: find the single number that
says how far out of step the two oscillators

12
00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:38.190
are.
